<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 Timoteho</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a myole wa Pahuli huli Timoteho</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoteho</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a myole wa Pahuli huli</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoteho</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu taangu moyi, Pahuli miikoto kondaayi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:9">2.9</ref></char>). Nde asonihi muhanda a myole huli Timoteho, mu uyibwala nde moonyi mu matumili ma tsyelele ma nde hutso isalu hya Timoteho. Ba banzuhisini aba baamiibata Pahuli (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:15">1.15</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10-16">4.10-16</ref></char>). Ka nde ayaabi ti nde aka bebele mu usukasa idingu hya nde (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:6">4.6</ref></char>). Ni mu buuna, nde ali mu uva mabwehe ma tsyelele huli Timoteho, tsyengi a nde wu isalu, wu nde haba hatondo we mwaana a nde.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda mo wunuuwu bibaayaka mu umweese idingu hya Pahuli hyoosi: isalu hya nde we iluumbi hya Nzambi, ndongisili a nde, mapasi moosi ma nde hamoni mu tooni Musamu wu Mubwe. Pahuli bibaayaka mu uva mandoongi huli Timoteho. Mu ubaandiha, nde bibaayaka mu ulongese mwaana a nde Timoteho, buni nde kaka hafwana umono pasi mu tooni isalu mu nduhi a Kristo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:1-13">2.1-13</ref></char>). Titswene, nde bibaayaka mu utuma Timoteho mu uyabisa mambu ma Nzambi bubwe-bubwe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:14-4:15">2.14–4.15</ref></char>). Ni mu buuna Timoteho hafwana ubata bileedi, na utehe mbisa huli banga a ndyatili yi yavele lisunga. Timoteho afwana mu uduukala mbiili a Pahuli. Nde afwana ukangama mu ma Pahuli na milongisi mikima mya mu Kristo, baalongisi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bu bambangi batsomi ba Yisu bu udimbala, ba bu usa isalu mbisa a bo, bo bafwana uduukala nzila a ba baatswamina. Ni mu buuna, bo bafwana ukeelese ndongisili yi bo baayaki huli milongisi mya bo, hwavele utengeme. Bo bafwana kaka uba bayihi bababwe ba Mihanda mya Ngidi. Mu taangu yi Pahuli hasonihi mihanda mo miina huli Timoteho, Mabuuku ma Ngidi mo maana ma bo baakasalila, maba ma Nzuhisini bibaayaka Likulu. Peleve bo baaba na mwa makima ma Nzuhisini bibaayaka Linyatihi. Mabuuku mo maana mosi «mali na tsalu mu ulongese imbuli, mu ulembesene baatu, mu usuungaha mi myatengeme, mu ubita muutu hu idingu hi bukuhu» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 3:16">3.16</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Me Pahuli, iluumbi hya Yisu Kristo, mu litondo la Nzambi. Me ndi iluumbi mu uyabisa moonyi wu bilima na bilima, wu Nzambi hasiidi nzuhisini huli ba baakangama mu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Me ndi mu utsonehele we Timoteho, mwaana a me wu litondo: Nyaha Nzambi Taata na Yisu Kristo, Pfumu a bisu bava we hyese, litondo na hyenze.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pfutili matondo na kwadisili mu uveletengeme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Me ndi mu upfutala ŋa matondo huli Nzambi, wu me ndi mu utsalila we bakaaha ba me, na matsimi ma me ma maatsyeme. Na me umbanzibwala moonyi mu we, butsuhu na nyangu, mu masambulu ma me. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Me ndi mu unzibwala moonyi mu matsanga ma we<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">matsanga ma we </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu muhanda a tsitusu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1:3">1Ti 1.3</ref></char> Pahuli bibaayaka mu utoyo mu kabwili a nde buna Timoteho hu musyenge a Efeso.</note>, na me na lehemene bibaayaka ubwemono we, mana me ndula mu kinya. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Me ndi mu unzibwala moonyi kaka mu hiitu hya we hya mbuli. Ni hiitu hya mu Nzambi hiina, kaaha a we Loyisi na ngu a we Enisi, baabedi na hyo. Me ndi mu umono ti we kaka ka mu usa hiitu mu Yisu.<verse eid="2TI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli bibaayaka mu uhwadisa Timoteho mu ukwilala wu avangama mu hiitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu unzibwala we moonyi mu udukasana mbaahu bungodu. Ni hyese hya Nzambi hiina, hi we ayaki ŋa me atsuusili we myoho. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Mu tooni ati, Livupu bibaayaka Nzambi hava bisu, a bibaayaka uba yombidi ve. Ka lo lili la kwadili, bibaayaka litondo na bibaayaka isusi.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Ni mu buuna, a hamono tsonyi mu imbangi hi we usa mu Pfumu a bisu. A hamono kaka tsonyi mu me, wu uli kondaayi mu tooni a Pfumu. Ka siinga umono pasi na me mu Musamu wu Mubwe, mu mifudi mi Nzambi ubaava.<verse eid="2TI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Nde ni wu ayobolo bisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 1:9">na wu ateele bisu mu mbila ya ngidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:9">a mu tooni mavaanga ma bisu ma mabwe ve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 1:9">ka mu tooni a kesili a nde mwakulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 1:9">na mu tooni bubwe bwa nde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:9">Nde asa bisu kolo-kolo a nde mu Yisu Kristo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 1:9">tswamina mbandili a taangu.<verse eid="2TI 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Ka nde amiimweese bisu bwo taangu yiniiyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 1:10">mu monihili a Muyobili a bisu Yisu Kristo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:10">Nde ni wu asukasa matwala ma lipfu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 1:10">na mu Musamu wu Mubwe, nde amweese moonyi wu ubaavelekwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Ni mu Musamu wu Mubwe, Nzambi habyalisa me we iluumbi hya nde na mulongisi. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Na, ni mu buuna, me ndi mu umono mapasi mo maniima. Ka me a handi na tsonyi ve, mu tooni ati me nzaabi mu na me atsa hiitu hya me. Me na hiitu mu nde, wu uli na matwala ma ukeelese bi nde hava me, natee mu ilumbu hya tsundusu. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Volo ifwaani mu ndongisili ya mbuli yi me anzabisa we, na hwada mu imiinu hya Nzambi. Titswene, hwada mu utondo baatu mutso itwadi hya na Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Keelese mandoongi ma talu, ma we ayaka mu likumbasa bibaayaka Livupu la Ngidi bibaayaka lili mu bisu.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />We bu we yabi, boosi ba itaanzi hya Asiya, baamiitimba me. Baatu we Fizeli na Emozeni. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Ka nyaha Pfumu alusa kwili a nde lingebe mu nzo a Onezifole, mu tooni ati nde akahwadisa me taangu yoosi. Na nde a hamono tsonyi mu me wu uli mu kondaayi ve. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Bu Onezifole hayato hu musyenge a Looma, nde asahi me na lehemene loosi, natee bu nde hayasoolo me. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Nyaha Pfumu ataasila nde, mu kwili lingebe a nde, mu ilumbu hya tsundusu! We afula kaka uyaba ma mabwe moosi ma nde havangili me hu musyenge a Efeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lisadaadu la Yisu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Ni mu buuna, we mwaana a me, hwada mu matwala ma hyese hi hili mu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Buuna, ndongisili yi we ayuhi huli me, ŋa busu bu bambangi ba banzuhisini, toosele yo huli baatu ba lisunga, mana bo kaka batwala ulongese yo huli bakima.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Siinga mapasi na me, we bu lisadaadu lilibwe la Yisu Kristo lahwada. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Lisadaadu bibaayaka litondi uyusa pfumu a nde, utwala ubwekangama mu misamu mi myavele mi isalu hya nde ve. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Bumosi kaka, muyeni a tiinu utwala uyaka mutata a mbingili ve, tso nde a hadukili mikele mya nzyenili a tiinu ve. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Musali a ngundu wu ubaasala hu unono, afwana uba watsomi mu utsonzehe muhunu. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Sinzatsikaha mambu ma me ndi mu undele we. Buuna, Pfumu uva we buyedi bu uyaba moosi.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Yibwala moonyi mu Yisu Kristo, wu imbisa hya pfumu Davidi na wu asuuhi mu ba baakwa, we bu Musamu wu Mubwe wu me ndi mu undongese ali mu uyabisa. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Ni mu tooni a Musamu wu Mubwe wunuwu, me ndi mu umono pasi. Mu nde, baamiihada me mapanga we mudubi a baatu. Ka a mambu ma Nzambi bahada mapanga ve. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu ukunda moosi, mu libwe la baa Nzambi hasoolo. Maana moosi mali mu uvangama, mana kaka bayaka ayobolo bo kaka, na ukotese bo mu muyusu wu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Musamu a mbuli ni wunuwu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">Tso bisu likwidi na Yisu Kristo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">bisu lu uba kaka moonyi na nde.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Tso bisu lihwadi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">bisu kaka lu utuma na nde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Ka tso bisu lituni nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">nde kaka utunala bisu.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Tso bisu liyehuli nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">Yisu Kristo akwilala wu akuha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">Ka nde utwala utunala nde mwakulu ve.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musalili wu Pfumu ali mu usilasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Yibwala maana moosi huli baatu boosi. Yibusa bo na ibahala hyoosi, ŋa busu bwa Nzambi we mbangi, mu ubaavelekakana mu mikuma. Ukakana mo huuna a huli na tsongo ve. Hwo hubaalobese ba bubaatehe matswi, mu uyuha maana. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Hwada mu uba wu asungama ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. Ba we musalili wu uli mu usa isalu hya nde na lisunga, hwavele a tsonyi. Toosele mambu ma mbuli huli baatu, we bu hwafwana. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Peke biledi bi byavele lisunga na bitoyili bi bangoyi. Ba bubaasa biledi mo biina, bubaasinzatahuha na Nzambi. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Ndongisili a baatu mo baana, yili we mbaadi yi yili na mavinya, yi yili mu uroto. Ifwaani mo hinihi, hyayelemene na Imene buna Filete. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Bo baamiitahuha na imbuli, na bo bali mu upfuta baa mukristo ba banzuhisini. Bo bali mu ubaalongese ti tsuuhili a baatu mu babaakwa, yamiikwavangama na a lafwana mu ubwekeele yo ve. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Ka, bibene bi byabama, bi Nzambi hatunga, bili mu ukwilala. Ŋa yulu a byo, baavala mambu mo maniima: «Pfumu yabi baatu ba nde.» Na, «Pasi muutu wu uleele ti nde bibaayaka mu Pfumu, afwana usiisa mavaanga ma mabi!»<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Mutso a nzo yinene, huli bisalili bya pila mu pila. Huli na bisalili bikima bya wolo, buuve bi bitali bya talu. Ka huli kaka na bikoombe bi bavala mu miti, buuve mu diha. Byatsomi bi bubaasalila mu mikungi miminene, bina bi bubaasalila kele tsuhu. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Ni mu buuna, tso muutu bibaayaka mu uswaha linyutu la nde, na utahuha na mavaanga ma mabi maana, nde afwanina we bisalili bya tsalu, bya ngidi, huli nga byo, bya tsongo mu pasi mavaanga ma mabwe.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Bata mapeyu ma bufudu. Duukala mbiili yi butsiitsa, yi imiinu, yi litondo, ya hyenze, yi itwadi na boosi ba bubaasambila Pfumu mu mutima wu atsyeme. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Bisa bileedi bi butsudu. We yaabi ti byo bi baatelemese mikaakunu. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />A hwafwana huli musalili a Pfumu mu uba na mikaakunu ve. Ka nde afwana uba nga isusi ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi. Muutu wu utwala ulongese, na ukunda ma mabi moosi ma baatu bu uleele mu nde. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Nde afwana usuungaha mu bulembo, baa bubaatelemene nde, peleve Nzambi utwala usobo mbiili a bo, mu uyaba imbuli. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Bo utwala uyafutaha mu matsimi ma tsiki, na upala mu myeto mi Mukuyi. Nde wu bedi amiikanga bo baa moonyi, mu ususa bo hutso lituma la nde.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Bilumbu bya tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Yibwala moonyi mu mambu mo maniima: hu tsukusu a taangu, sa uba na bilumbu bya pasi. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Baatu bu uba na nyinga, na linyungi la mbongo, na nyeme, na isaayi. Basafuli baa bungidi bwa Nzambi, banga kene ŋa busu bu bataata na bangu. Bo bu uba baa buveletwala ufutala matondo, bangoyi. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Baatu bu uba banga kamini mutima, bu ubisa unoongo na bambaahi, banga makusa, ba baavelekuta linyutu, banga a kasa, ba baabelele ma mabwe. <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />Baatu bu uba basumbisi ba bana, banga mafufu, banga lidadu, ba baafulala utondo makinya ma bo hwavele utondo Nzambi. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Bo sa bayusa Nzambi hutso muwala, ka bo bubaatuna ti matwala ma Nzambi matuma idiingu hya bo. Tahuha na baatu mo baana.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Me nzalusa benu, huli na bakima ŋa hati la bo babali mu utsodomo we miibi mutso manzo na ubaasoho bakaasu babaavele na dyeele, ba baaluula na mipfuna mi masumu, ba baayunga na banga manzala ma pila mu pila. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Bo bali mu ukwilala mu uyiha ndongisili yi nyatihi, hwavele utwala utsikaha imbuli hya Nzambi. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />We bu Yanesi na Yambese baatelimini Moose, bumosi kaka, baatu mobaniba, bali mu utuna imbuli. Bo bali baatu banga matsimi ma mamiisahuha na imiinu hya bo hili hya mupu. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Ka bo a bu uto lala ve. Mu tooni ati baatu boosi sa bayaba butsudu bwa bo. We bu hwaba mu Yanesi na Yambese.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandoongi ma tsukusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Ka we, we aduukili me mu ndongisili a me, mu ndyatili a me, mu makani ma me, mu imiinu hya me, mu mukami a me, mu litondo la me, mu mukonono a me, mu usungama tso mu ibahala hya me, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />hutso a mbingisili na mapasi ma me. Ki mapasi me avelembwana na mo, hu misyenge mya Antyokya, Ikoniwumi na Lisitele! Ki mbingisili me avelekunda! Ka mu moosi, Pfumu ayobili me. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Boosi ba bali mu utondo udyata bu hwasungama mu Yisu Kristo, bu ubwana mbingisili. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Ka baatu banga mavaanga ma mabi, banga a soho, bu usinzakagama mu bubi bwa bo. Bo bu usoho bakima, na bu udunga bo mwakulu. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Ka we, kangama mu ma we ayiha mu bisu, na ma we ayaka mu mutima mumosi. We yabi huli na we ayiha mo. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Umata hu hati bumwana bwa we, we yabi Mabasonehe ma Ngidi. Maana moosi, ni ma mu utwala hwadisa imiinu hya we na uva we liyobolo mu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Mambu moosi ma baasonehe mu Muhanda a Ngidi, mali mu umata huli Nzambi. Maana moosi mali na tsalu mu ulongese baatu, mu usyembe, mu usuungaha na mu uyihasa bo hutso butsiitsa. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />Mono buni hwafwana mu uba, mana musalili a Nzambi aba wu avangama na wu akuha, mu usa pasi isalu hi ibwe.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Uyabisa Mambu ma Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Me tumi we ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, na ŋa busu bwa Yisu Kristo wu utsundasa ba bali moonyi na babaakwa, bu nde hu uyamonehele mu Ipfumu hya nde. <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Yabisa Mambu ma Nzambi, na mukonono, tso mu taangu yimbwe, tso mu taangu yimbi. Pamina, syembe, hwadisa baatu na kwilala mu ulongese bo na mukami woosi.<verse eid="2TI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Ka sa huba na taangu yi baatu bu ubwevelekunda ndongisili a mambu ma mbuli. Ka mu mapeyu ma bo mwakulu, bo sa bakangama mu ndongisili yi milongisi mi milahi, we bu hwafwana na mapeyu ma bo mwakulu. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Bo buudibuha matswi ma bo, mu uveleyuha imbuli. Bo buukinguha mu ubaayuha makuma ma mapfuta. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Ka we, kuta linyutu la we mu moosi. Kunda mapasi, yabisa Musamu wu Mubwe, na kuhasa bu hwafwana isalu hya we hi musalili a Nzambi.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Me miimana tiinu, me miikeelese imiinu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Me Pahuli, me ndi mu umono ti taangu a me yaka bebele mu uyeholo muvumu a me we bungodu bu musiitu huli Pfumu. Tangu a me yi ukwa yimiito. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Me miindwana mudiingu we bu hwafwana mu ulwana. Me miitsukasa tiinu a me na me miikeelese imiinu. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Bunuubu, bamiiswehele me mutata a butsiitsa, humbisa a mbingili a me. Pfumu, nzonzi wa tsiitsa, wu utsundasa bu hwafwana, uva me mutata mo ilumbu mo hiina. Nde uva mutata, ndulu a huli me ve, ka napa huli boosi ba bali na lehemene bibaayaka ukeele monihili a nde.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manzabisili ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Leenge, sa moosi ma we utwala, we yabiisala me matsuhu mo maniima. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Yanga yabiisala me, me akasiha, mu tooni ati Demasi amiitimba me. Nde amiikangama mu makinya ma toto. Nde miiyene hu musyenge a Tesalonika. Keresenisi miiyene hu tsi a Ngalatiya, na Tiite hu tsi a Dalamatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Ndulu ni Luuka bibaayaka na me. Buuna, yanga we mwakulu na Malako, nde na tsongo mu me na mu isalu. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Me miitsindaha Tisiike hu musyenge a Efeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Ŋa we uya, behele me iyunga hi me atsiisa hu musyenge a Tolowasi mu nzo a Karaposi. We behi kaka mabuuku, homo ma mikobo mi bibulu. <verse eid="2TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alekizandi, mutsuli bitali, avangila me ma malahi ma maafulala bubi. Pfumu usyembe nde we bu huli mavaanga ma nde. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Baakele na nde we kaka, mu tooni ati, nde atelemene ndongisili a bisu mu mifudi.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Ŋa me anzakala nyutu a me kala latsomi, muutu tso mumosi a havolili me mileembe ve. Baatu boosi baatiimbi me. Nyaha Nzambi avengolo bo lo! <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Ka Pfumu ni wu avolili me mileembe. Nde aviidi me mifudi, mana me twala uyabisa bo Musamu wu Mubwe, mana baatu ba matsi ma bangoyi kaka bayuha nde. Na nde ayobili me mu munywa a kosi. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Pfumu ubiingasa me mu mavaanga moosi ma mabi. Nde uyobolo me na ukotese me mu Ipfumu hya nde hi mayulu. Muyusu aba huli nde mu bilima na bilima! Ameni!<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Va bwehe huli Pilisile, Akilasi, na baatu ba nzo a Onezifole. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erasite miisaala hu musyenge a Koliito. Me miitsisa Tolofime, hu ngulu makuumbi ma nzali a musyenge a Mile, hutso bubeedu. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Leenge mu uya, tswamina ndolo mu uto. Ebulusi, Pudenesi, Linyusi, Kolodiya na baana ba ngu boosi, batsindihi we bwehe.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Nyaha Pfumu aba na we, na hyese hya Nzambi hiba na benu.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>